/-- **`lem:local_integrability`** (Local integrability and differentiation).

For bounded continuous real `F_j` and a finite collection, `eq:cubeform` is
absolutely integrable and multilinear.

This is the absolute integrability of the cubical weight in the joint centre
and space variables. -/
theorem lem_local_integrability_cubeBracketWeight
    (α : Anisotropy) (q : AnisoBox α) {t : ℝ} (ht : 0 < t) :
    Integrable (fun z : E3 × E6 ↦ cubeBracketWeight α t z.1 z.2)
